  "href": "extensive_game/extensive_game_perfect_information_extensive_game.html",
  "body_html": "<h1>Finite Extensive Game With Perfect Information</h1>\n<p>A finite extensive form game with perfect information consists of:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>a finite nonempty player set $I$;</li>\n<li>a finite tree of nodes $Z$ with origin $\\theta$ and predecessor map;</li>\n<li>terminal nodes $R$ and decision positions $P=Z\\setminus R$;</li>\n<li>a successor set $S(p)$ for each decision position $p$;</li>\n<li>a partition $(P_i)_{i\\in I}$ of decision positions by the player who moves;</li>\n<li>payoff functions $g_i:R\\to\\mathbb R$.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Play starts at $\\theta$, follows successor choices at decision positions, stops at a\nterminal node $r\\in R$, and gives player $i$ payoff $g_i(r)$.</p>",
  "proof_html": null,
